 takes care of a hedgehog she found in the courtyard."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a strange air about her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She hates lies, whether they come from her or other people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Like the protagonist she doesn't have any friends and is always alone."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c70124"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f0b0ce306eb0b462823f695f76744746a7b16aec86aedd1ede6415b775dcee1e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4bef3e66be08754ce9be77cc45a41cafff400992be0f50717e1f076dad5f51cb.webp","width":185,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高垣 彩陽","creatorId":"vndb:s1764","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1764","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1764","name":"高垣彩陽","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:75443","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c70125","characterName":"アルカンジェ 舞渡華","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c70125"},"originalCharacterName":"アルカンジェ 舞渡華","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main personality of the protagonist's favorite radio program."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of his listeners' tremendous support, his program has been going for seven years and they've never run out of postcards coming in with people confiding their worries."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c70125"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f63b2201c81980d8f5514e69e700e8cc249813d2a409dd15f0bf6bf9c094d90.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/